Complete the following Dart switch-case code:

```dart
void main() {
  String flavor = 'Chocolate';
  %order% (%order%) {
    %order% %order%:
      print('Chocolate ice cream!');
      %order%;
  }
}
```

What is the output of the following Dart code?

```dart
void main() {
  String flavor = 'Vanilla';
  switch (flavor) {
    case 'Chocolate':
      print('Chocolate!');
      break;
    case 'Vanilla':
      print('Vanilla!');
      break;
    default:
      print('Unknown!');
  }
}
```

